  <text xml:lang="grc"><body xml:base="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.kreoysa.dindorf1893-grc1"><div type="edition" n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.kreoysa.dindorf1893-grc1" xml:lang="grc" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_kreoysa"><head>Κρέουσα</head><div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="321" xml:id="fragment-kreoysa-dindorf1893_grc1-321" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_kreoysa" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.kreoysa.nauck1889grc1:324">
            <note type="source">Stobaeus IV, 38.</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Ταῦτ᾽ ἐστὶν ἄλγιστ᾽, ἣν παρὸν θέσθαι καλῶς</l>
              <l n="2" xml:lang="grc">αὐτός τις αὑτῷ τὴν βλάβην προσθῇ φέρων.</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="322" xml:id="fragment-kreoysa-dindorf1893_grc1-322" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_kreoysa" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.kreoysa.nauck1889grc1:325">
            <note type="source">Stobaeus VII, 8.</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Ὅστις δὲ τόλμῃ πρὸς τὸ δεινὸν ἔρχεται,</l>
              <l n="2" xml:lang="grc">ὀρθὴ μὲν ἡ γλῶσσ᾽ ἐστὶν, ἀσφαλὴς δ᾽ ὁ νοῦς.</l>
            </lg>
            <note type="apparatus">V. 1. τόλμης Elmsl. ad Medeam p. 146.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="323" xml:id="fragment-kreoysa-dindorf1893_grc1-323" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_kreoysa" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.kreoysa.nauck1889grc1:326">
            <note type="source">Stobaeus XII, 4.</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Καλὸν μὲν οὖν οὐκ ἔστι τὰ ψευδῆ λέγειν·</l>
              <l n="2" xml:lang="grc">ὅτῳ δ᾽ ὄλεθρον δεινὸν ἁλήθει᾽ ἄγει,</l>
              <l n="3" xml:lang="grc">συγγνωστὸν εἰπεῖν ἐστι καὶ τὸ μὴ καλόν.</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="324" xml:id="fragment-kreoysa-dindorf1893_grc1-324" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_kreoysa">
            <note type="source">Stobaeus XXXVIII, 26.</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Οὔτε γὰρ γάμον, ὦ φίλαι,</l>
              <l n="2" xml:lang="grc">οὔτ᾽ ἂν ὄλβον ἔκμετρον</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="325" xml:id="fragment-kreoysa-dindorf1893_grc1-325" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_kreoysa" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.kreoysa.pearson1917-grc1:354">
            <note type="source">Stobaeus XCI, 28.</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Καὶ μή τι θαυμάσῃς με τοῦ κέρδους, ἄναξ,</l>
              <l n="2" xml:lang="grc">ὧδ᾽ ἀντέχεσθαι. καὶ γὰρ οἱ μακρὸν βίον</l>
              <l n="3" xml:lang="grc">θνητῶν ἔχουσι, τοῦ γε κερδαίνειν ὅμως</l>
              <l n="4" xml:lang="grc">ἀπρὶξ ἔχονται· κἄστι πρὸς τὰ χρήματα</l>
              <l n="5" xml:lang="grc">θνητοῖσι τἄλλα δεύτερ᾽· εἰσὶ δ᾽ οἵτινες</l>
              <l n="6" xml:lang="grc">αἰνοῦσιν ἄνοσον ἄνδρ᾽, ἐμοὶ δ᾽ οὐδεὶς δοκεῖ</l>
              <l n="7" xml:lang="grc">εἶναι πένης ὢν ἄνοσος, ἀλλ᾽ ἀεὶ νοσεῖν.</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="326" xml:id="fragment-kreoysa-dindorf1893_grc1-326" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_kreoysa" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.kreoysa.nauck1889grc1:329">
            <note type="source">Stobaeus CIII, 15.</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Κάλλιστόν ἐστι τοὔνδικον πεφυκέναι·</l>
              <l n="2" xml:lang="grc">λῴστον δὲ τὸ ζῆν ἄνοσον· ἥδιστον δ᾽ ὅτῳ</l>
              <l n="3" xml:lang="grc">πάρεστι λῆψις ὧν ἐρᾷ καθ᾽ ἡμέραν.</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="327" xml:id="fragment-kreoysa-dindorf1893_grc1-327" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_kreoysa" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.kreoysa.nauck1889grc1:330">
            <note type="source">Grammaticus Bekkeri p. 373, 5. Ἀκουστά: ὡς ἐν τῇ (codex τῷ) Κρεούσῃ</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Ἄπελθ᾽ ἄπελθε, παῖ· τάδ᾽ οὐκ ἀκουστά σοι.</l>
            </lg>
            <note type="commentary">(σοι om. codex) καὶ Εὐριπίδης δὲ πολλάκις. ὁ μέντοι Σοφοκλῆς ἀκούσιμά φησι.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="328" xml:id="fragment-kreoysa-dindorf1893_grc1-328" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_kreoysa" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.kreoysa.nauck1889grc1:331">
            <note type="source">Hesychius, Ἀνέκτημαι: ἀνειληφα. Σ. Κ.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="329" xml:id="fragment-kreoysa-dindorf1893_grc1-329" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_kreoysa" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.kreoysa.nauck1889grc1:332">
            <note type="source">Pollux VI, 174. Τὸ δὲ ἰσοθάνατον Σοφοκλέους εἰπόντος ἐν Κρεούσῃ οὐ πάνυ ἀνεκτόν.</note>
          </div>
        </div></body></text></TEI>
